</span><span>．</span><span>法律法规规章规定的其他内容。</span></p>\n<p><span>评标委员会成员姓名应当以编码标注的方式替代。</span></p>\n<p><span>二、</span><span>评标委员会对中标候选人投标文件的打分情况、中标候选人及其管理人员的业绩（包括资格业绩和商务加分业绩）、中标候选人管理人员的相关证书名称和编号公示信息等内容较多时，可以以汇总表形式（详见附表1、2、3）公示。</span></p>\n<p><span>三、</span><span>中标候选人是联合体的，“中标候选人名称”中联合体各方的名称均应填写。</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span><br/>\n</span></p>\n<p><span>附表</span><span>1</span></p>\n<p><span>评标委员会成员对中标候选人的打分情况公示表</span></p>\n<div>\n<table class=\"bid-table\" style=\"width:1382.55px\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span>中标候选人</span></p>\n<p><span>排序</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span>中标候选人名称</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span>打分分项</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span>评委1</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span>评委2</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div></div>", "html": "", "method": "中标候选人", "region": "重庆", "buyer": "重庆青年职业技术学院", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [{"url": "https://www.cqggzy.com/uploadFiles/%E9%87%8D%E5%BA%86%E5%B8%82%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E7%BD%91%E6%96%B0%E7%89%88%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C.pdf", "name": "%E9%87%8D%E5%BA%86%E5%B8%82%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E7%BD%91%E6%96%B0%E7%89%88%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C.pdf", "ext": "pdf"}, {"url": "https://fgw.fujian.gov.cn/ztzl/cjzxjyzx/", "name": "attachment", "ext": "download"}, {"url": "https://ggzydl.cqggzy.com/CQTPBidder/jsgcztbmis2/pages/zbfilelingqu_hy/cQZBFileDownAttachAction.action?cmd=download&AttachGuid=708c55c6-f49a-4bda-aeb9-5d4372a31786&code=JD023&tradeGuid=8ac7c58f-bef4-49b4-aa91-cf714bd15fcd", "name": "708c55c6", "ext": "download"}], "hasAttachment": true, "is_bidding": true}